WEBVTT

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.560
hug 3 "Molesting. Just don't do it."

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.560
"Her ailment is unknown.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:09.320
The symptoms are wide-ranging,
from peripheral joint inflammation

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:09.320
Nitto Talent Agency
Takato Saijo

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.530
Mid-Afternoon Star

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:13.400
to pyoderma gangrenosum
to a malignant tumor in the digestive tract."

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.570
<i>The lines with medical jargon
are pretty difficult this time around.</i>

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.950
<i>And when they're long lines like this...</i>

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.330
<i>I'm glad I turned down the invite
to go drinking tonight after all.</i>

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:26.790
All right! We'll drink at the yakitori restaurant
over there until they run out of booze!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.090
Yeah!

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.170
<i>I wanted to go drinking, too.
Maybe I'll pour myself one when I get home.</i>

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.430
<i>I should have two bottles left in the fridge.</i>

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.680
<i>Someone else got in...</i>

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:42.890
<i>That day I realized...</i>

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.940
<i>I realized the humiliation...</i>

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.610
<i>of being gorged on by him.</i>

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:53.240
<i>And the terror of being harassed by him.</i>

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.870
Good work today, Takato.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.000
Chun... ta?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.380
Can I sit next to you?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.380
Mitsuya Production
Junta Azumaya

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:38.220
How's the temperature in here?
Want me to kick it up?

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.260
No, too dry wouldn't be good either.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.720
I'll just borrow a blanket.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.850
<i>Am I half-asleep?</i>

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:48.180
<i>For a second there,
I thought I saw a starving beast.</i>

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.440
Well, here we go.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.440
I'm closing this curtain, so get some rest.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.270
All right, thank you.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.160
Here you go, Takato.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.370
Oh, that was thoughtful of you.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:10.160
Yes. Better to be safe than sorry, I thought.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.040
Yeah.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.210
<i>It wouldn't do to catch a cold during the shoot.</i>

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:16.750
What about you?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:20.130
For now, I'm fine, as long as you have one.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.550
Oh. Okay.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:27.640
<i>It feels like this conversation
isn't going anywhere. Or more like...</i>

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:28.970
<i>He's close!</i>

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:34.270
You were invited
to go out drinking tonight too, weren't you?

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.480
You turned it down?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.570
I heard you weren't going, so...

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.570
<i>Ugh, it's annoying when he gets clingy.</i>

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.120
In this business, it's important to be social.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.330
Although it does depend on the members...

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:53.500
Right, but I thought if I got on the bus now,
it would just be the two of us.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.090
So I gave in to temptation.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.380
<i>Sheesh. What's with this guy?</i>

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:04.970
I-It's not just the two of us.
Mr. Isomori is up front driving.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.300
Move over a bit.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.510
- You're too close!
- It's the two of us.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.230
Just you and me in the back seat. All alone.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.560
I said you're too close...

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.650
H-Hey, what are you...

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.780
If he opens that curtain, he'll see us.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.370
Chunta, don't tell me you're... Hey...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.370
If you're just a little quiet,
we won't have any trouble.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.880
Wait, wait. Don't be reckless.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.750
We can't do this here.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.750
<i>Molesting. Just don't do it!</i>

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:49.850
Takato, move your hand.
And don't close your legs. I can't touch you.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.770
Don't touch me.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.060
I want to touch you.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.100
Don't touch me, pervert.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.320
Then I'll start here.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.820
<i>Where does he think we are?</i>

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.370
Oh, you're loosening up.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.830
<i>This is a location bus!</i>

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.410
Now do you like it?

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.880
Who could... like that?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.380
Go to hell, you perv.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.680
Awe, man.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:32.770
We're in a traffic jam.
That's unusual at this late hour.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.850
<i>Traffic jam?</i>

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:38.150
Saijo, Azumaya...

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.560
<i>Hey, the curtain!</i>

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.900
Looks like the traffic
is because of some accident.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.410
<i>The curtain!</i>

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:55.330
Saijo is fast asleep?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:56.660
Yes.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.000
<i>Hurry up. Hurry up, and close...</i>

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.920
If it's going to take a while longer,
I'll probably take a nap, too.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:09.510
Good idea. I'll wake you up when we get there.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:10.890
Thank you.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.060
Takato...

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.740
Chunta, stop it already.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.660
Are you sure you want me to stop?

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.750
Did you see that show
with Takato Saijo last night?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.210
Yeah, I saw it! He's so dreamy!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.130
Takato, are you feeling good...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:55.760
Mr. Isomori.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:56.850
Yes?

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.600
Could you just go straight to my place?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:03.110
The two of us have decided
to run lines tonight.

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.110
Takato, um...

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.910
Can I carry you to the bathtub?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.410
Yes, go ahead.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.500
You can hit me as much as you like.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:20.960
Sorry.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.460
Don't apologize!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:26.550
If you're going to apologize, wait until after
I'm done expressing my anger at you!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.800
You sneaky bastard!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.130
Sorry.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:35.140
When I thought how the shoot is almost over,
I couldn't help but get greedy.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.390
<i>Over?</i>

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.230
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.770
<i>We don't have that many scenes left to shoot.</i>

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:48.480
Cut! Okay, that'll do!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.780
Good work.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.400
I was so nervous!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.910
Azumaya and Saijo,
you guys were perfect, too!

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.660
Is it because of the rehearsing
you did last night?

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.490
Assistant Director
of "Mid-Afternoon Star"
Hayato Isomori

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.490
That's right!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.410
I've been blessed with a fabulous cast,
and I couldn't be happier.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.410
Director of
"Mid-Afternoon Star"
Tomio Torimachi

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:06.960
Next time I'll make it
a quieter kind of drinking, so join us, okay?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.050
Yes, of course.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.630
But I had Takato with me last night.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.850
Huh? A water bottle flew through the air.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.430
Sorry. It slipped out of my hands.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:22.020
Are you okay, Azumaya?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.350
Takato! I'm perfectly fine.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:29.280
No, there's definitely
something wrong with your head.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.740
I'd better operate on it right away!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.530
- He's an angel again today.
- Those two keep getting closer and closer.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.490
Hou-On Agency
Kaori Mizuki

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.490
Nitto Talent Agency
Kanoko Shiraishi

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:35.320
- Come with me, you insatiable, perverted angel!
- O-Okay!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.320
Close, huh?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.120
Saijo's got it rough.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.870
Takato, Azumaya, sorry to interrupt your fun.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.750
This isn't fun at all!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.330
Takato Saijo's Manager
Takumi Sasaki

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.460
Can I ask you two to do an interview?
People from the media are here.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.960
- Sure!
- Yes!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.970
<i>There's more to an actor's job
than just performing.</i>

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:56.430
Mid-Afternoon Star

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.430
<i>During the shooting period, there are
interviews for newspapers and magazines...</i>

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.140
<i>appearances on TV shows,
TV commercial shoots.</i>

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.020
<i>These are all duties assigned to the main cast.</i>

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.310
<i>It's important work that you must do
to promote the movie as much as possible.</i>

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:10.270
Mr. Saijo, what did you think
when your co-star, Mr. Azumaya,

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.860
stole your number one spot
for "Sexiest Man of the Year,"

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.610
a position you held for five years in a row?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.490
It seems Azumaya
really is a rising star these days.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.410
It's too bad you lost your number one position.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.540
Did you say anything about it to Mr. Azumaya?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.920
Why do you think you fell to second place
of "Sexiest Man of the Year"?

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.130
Do you have any regrets?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.420
What do you think you have to do
to regain first place?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.590
A few words to your fans?

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.630
Takato Saijo

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.180
One's as bad as the next! This is unbelievable!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.350
It was supposed to be an interview for the movie,
so ask me movie-related questions!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:42.850
You can't blame them.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.890
The "Sexiest Man of the Year" and runner-up

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.400
are co-starring in "Mid-Afternoon Star,"
so it's a hot topic.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.560
People are curious.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.570
It's fine with me.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:57.530
If its gets butts in seats to watch the movie,
then it was worth it.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.410
Nice interview, Takato.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.330
Have a hot chocolate.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:02.280
Gimme!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.870
Thank you. Especially when
you also must be tired, Azumaya.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:11.380
No, not at all.
I always enjoy spending time with Takato.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.710
- Really?
- Yes!

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:15.260
We've got three interviews tomorrow.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:20.470
Oh, that's right. And the magazine aniani
wants to get a conversation between you two.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.180
- Aniani?
- Conversation?

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:28.060
<i>Aniani is the magazine that publishes
the "Sexiest" rankings.</i>

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.190
<i>There's no doubt they'll get us to talk about that.</i>

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.270
Number One Junta Azumaya

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.740
It seems they want to do a special feature
to coincide with the opening of the movie.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:41.070
Of course, along with the conversation,
they want to get a lot of photos.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.160
I know it'll be hard on you
when you're already busy shooting, but...

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.250
It'll be good publicity for the movie, right?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.830
Naturally.
They'd like the two of you on the cover.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.340
I'd be happy to do it.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:58.420
If it means working with Takato,
I'd jump at the chance.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.430
<i>We're only going to be working together
for a little longer.</i>

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:12.060
Wonderful, wonderful!
Takato and Azumaya, both of you!

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.820
Hey, aren't you too close?

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:15.770
But look...

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:19.650
- They're up against each other!
- Women seem to like this kind of thing.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.490
Quiet!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.780
I want to change it around.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.120
Cameraman
Julio Mitsudani

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:28.290
Takato, Azumaya, would you move around
while smoking a cigarette?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:29.580
Sure.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:30.920
Um...

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.590
Yes?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.090
Nothing.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.300
Don't say anything.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.380
But you don't like smoking, right?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:45.260
Photographers are trying to get
the best photos they can.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:49.310
You do whatever it is they tell you to do.
That's what a professional does.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.180
But...

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.350
You're a professional too, aren't you?

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.660
I'm not doing this for your sake.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.410
It's for the fans.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.470
I was watching the photo shoot
for you two earlier

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.550
and was struck by how close you two are.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.970
Yes, we are close!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:28.930
Normally so.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:33.020
First off, what did you think when you were
chosen as the "Sexiest Man of the Year"?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.270
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:42.070
I think that as a man, it's been an honor
to be chosen by women every time.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.070
Azumaya, I believe this is your first time
to be voted number one, so what did you think?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.580
I was a little surprised, but overjoyed.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.080
Well, I knew I couldn't stay
in first place forever.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.920
It seemed to be a good time
for a "changing of the guard."

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:59.000
Congratulations for taking first place, Azumaya.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.630
Yes, thank you.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.510
That's amazing, Mr. Saijo.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.930
It's so befitting for someone who was voted
number one five years in a row.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.640
It's so beautiful that it's dazzling.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:12.140
<i>That's right. You're dealing with
the superstar actor, Takato Saijo.</i>

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.390
<i>I haven't been in this business
for 20 years for nothing.</i>

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:18.480
<i>I'll get through this conversation
in the coolest manner ever.</i>

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.320
Have you two ever been madly in love
with someone?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:27.160
There are many charming women
all around me,

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.370
but unfortunately, I'm just so busy.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.160
Right now, work is my mistress.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.950
That makes sense.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.460
Being devoted to your career
is very like you, Mr. Saijo.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.670
Mr. Azumaya, how about—

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:38.330
I have.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.250
<i>Hey, what are you talking about?</i>

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.920
<i>What do you intend to confess?</i>

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:44.630
Um, who is it?!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.430
My idol, the person I look up to.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.600
When I met this person,
my heart beat wildly for the first time.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:57.390
The color of the world changed, and I
became hooked, as you do when you're in love.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.320
That person is my everything.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:06.200
Of course I'm thrilled
that a great many women are fans

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.910
and think I'm the "Sexiest Man of the Year,"

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:13.870
but more than anything,
I want to become that person's "Sexiest Man".

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.960
<i>"My everything," come on now!
That's an exaggeration.</i>

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.970
And that's a wrap for "Mid-afternoon Star"!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.850
<i>Once filming of the movie is finished,
the actor's work is done.</i>

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.730
<i>My days of being intimidated by him
are over, too.</i>

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.940
Takato Saijo

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.520
<i>Now I'll regain a peaceful life.</i>

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.690
Takato!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.900
What's up? It's open.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.280
Takato, thank you!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.500
Wh-Why are you thanking me?

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.330
I've had so much fun being with you.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.380
But that's not all.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:05.840
Thanks to you, I feel like
I've really grown as an actor.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.800
My idol was, is, and shall always be Takato Saijo.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.560
Don't be satisfied with this.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.680
You've been an actor for three years.
You're still wet behind the ears.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:20.140
Right.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:23.310
Actors don't have a goal.
Each project you take on is a challenge.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:24.690
Right!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:25.520
And...

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.570
I wouldn't mind it
if you called me once in a while.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.530
Right!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.200
But I'll come see you every day.

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:40.870
How?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.580
By car.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.500
Please let me pick you up after work.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.710
Wait a second!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.970
When you sounded sad because the shoot
was almost over, what was that?

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:56.600
I was sad about not being able
to touch you while at work anymore.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:00.180
But I'll make up for it
by touching you a lot outside of work.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.560
Hey, where are you touching me?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.060
Sorry.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:06.770
Here, 1,000 yen.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:11.200
Th-That's enough, you horny angel!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:16.910
<i>Apparently my days of being harassed
are going to continue for a while.</i>

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.660
Mid-Afternoon Star
Staff and Cast Screening

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.340
<i>Not a bad performance.</i>

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.460
<i>Even my fellow actors and crew members
are riveted to the screen.</i>

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.420
<i>That magnetism...</i>

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.900
<i>The man who stole the first place ranking
of "Sexiest Man of the Year"</i>

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:51.990
<i>from me, Takato Saijo, a superstar actor
with 20 years of experience...</i>

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:57.450
<i>He looks harmless,
but is actually a bloodthirsty carnivore.</i>

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>He's been harassing me on a daily basis.</i>

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:02.710
<i>But...</i>

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.760
<i>I'm glad we had the chance to work together.</i>

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.730
And now I'll announce the results.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.820
The award for Best Actor in a Leading Role...

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.990
goes to Junta Azumaya, for "Mid-Afternoon Star"!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:15.590
Congratulations.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.300
Yes, thank you!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.850
Well, I'm happy for you.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.680
Thank you!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.810
Are you sure we can drink such a nice bottle?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.230
Snacks are in the fridge.
Take them out as you like.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.070
Right.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.030
Takato.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:42.490
What about the cake you bought?
Wand me to cut it?

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.830
No, give it to me like that.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.240
Just get me a fork.

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.290
Okay!

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:49.750
The director told me before.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:53.750
He said when you're in a bad mood,
you eat a whole cake by yourself.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.960
You got a problem with that?

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.840
No.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:59.840
<i>Saijo!</i>

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.510
If it hadn't been for that old man,

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.470
I would've won the award
for Best Actor in a Supporting Role!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.060
And now I'll announce the results.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.270
The award for Best Actor
in a Supporting Role goes to...

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:13.440
<i>Come to me!</i>

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.520
Kozaburo Nakata!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.490
Office Yen
Kozaburo Nakata

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:24.370
Congratulations, Mr. Nakata.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:29.580
Well, thanks. I'm sorry that an old man
like me stole it from you, Saijo.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:35.790
To be honest, I wish I could
give it to a promising young actor like yourself.

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.130
Not at all!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:42.760
I still have a lot to learn by watching you, sir.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.640
Really?

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:48.760
Then I guess I'll hold on to this
without any reservations.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.480
Challenge me again anytime, Saijo.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.230
I'm looking forward to it.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.650
Damn it! Did you see that?

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.650
The triumphant look on the old man's face!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.730
Hurry up, and retire!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.740
The elderly shouldn't be working that hard!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:06.530
But, Takato, you watch almost
all of Mr. Nakata's performances, don't you?

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:09.120
Yes! That old man is brilliant!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:15.170
Well, I didn't think he'd be brushed aside
and I'd just get the award.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:19.630
For our movie, we got Best Director
and you got Best Actor in a Leading Role.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:24.300
I wanted to make it a trifecta
by winning Best Supporting Actor.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.720
What? You want some, too?

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.220
- Oh, no.
- All right, fine.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.980
T-Takato.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.860
Just kidding!

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:45.650
Here, eat it yourself, dummy!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:46.820
Put your wings away!

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:50.030
<i>I'm the dummy! Acting as if we're a couple!</i>

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.080
Thank you.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.660
But if I'm going to eat, I'd rather have this.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.210
H-Hey!

00:21:58.880 --> 00:21:59.880
Th-This?!

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:04.050
- I'm not food.
- To me, you're the finest feast.

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.840
Open your mouth, Takato.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.050
Sweet.

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:18.940
Takato, I won the award for Best Actor.

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:23.360
When you told me "congratulations"
onstage at the awards,

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:27.610
I was so happy that I almost lost control
and ravished you.

00:22:28.910 --> 00:22:34.290
I won't do that, though,
because I want to stand with you again.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:41.710
So, have I become your "Sexiest Man"?

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:44.710
Cut it out.

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:48.800
Not on the sofa.

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:50.090
On a day like this...

00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:53.890
You're right.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:56.100
I'll take my time with you on the bed.

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:09.200
<i>I'll never tell him that I want to have sex.</i>

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:16.370
<i>I'll never say that, but just for today...</i>

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:24.170
<i>...I'll celebrate his award.</i>

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.840
Takato, just once.

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:31.340
"Teacher," okay? Just once.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:32.510
Takato.

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:33.760
Okay, once.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:35.680
Teacher...

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:37.730
Shall we continue?

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:39.980
hug 4 "I've been framed..."
